{"chunk_id": "underwriting_referral_guidelines-0001", "source": "data/knowledge/underwriting_referral_guidelines.md", "title": "Underwriting Referral Guidelines", "version": "2026.10", "text": "# Underwriting referral guideline\n\n## Property risk\n\nRefer a property submission to a senior underwriter when the model risk score is at\nleast 0.70, the requested exposure exceeds the delegated authority limit, or the\nsubmission contains incomplete material risk information. An automated service may\nrecommend a referral but must not bind coverage.\n\n## Evidence and traceability\n\nEvery recommendation must cite the policy version and the evidence chunk used. A\nhuman reviewer must approve, reject, or escalate a recommendation before a case is\nrouted to a downstream case-management system.", "embedding": [0.069818005, 0.03250988, -0.17336994, -0.075694636, 0.059260987, -0.0021939909, 0.040472735, 0.048794642, -0.0123898275, 0.003149554, 0.019956509, -0.0044534514, 0.064320415, -0.039634783, 0.006811152, -0.013172886, 0.02140402, -0.0317832, 0.012660621, 0.0033788455, -0.021458907, -0.08412048, -0.049089514, 0.0030110155, 0.049688917, 0.034120653, 0.010374497, -0.053088225, -0.026819535, -0.001222685, -0.0015822352, 0.01808718, 0.01722739, -0.07304526, -0.006610276, -0.064610094, 0.06678934, 0.046870675, -0.05099025, -0.039412457, 0.0026245946, 0.051174983, 0.0013820075, -0.010647727, 0.03619239, 0.0024700928, 0.09252487, -0.004265418, 0.029149631, 0.026265632, 0.053102225, -0.019902715, 0.030137727, 0.013500229, 0.04220906, 0.019399239, -0.026180675, 0.036639538, 0.00049019826, -0.031653825, 0.07970372, 0.051432528, -0.008739755, 0.04392195, 0.06952138, -0.008574654, -0.04048903, 0.02754624, 0.010154628, -0.012417231, -0.011441667, 0.026280869, -0.02199442, 0.004678898, -0.009847195, 0.00012349174, -0.016121296, -0.030878684, 0.009758764, 0.04536002, -0.0024597943, 0.03551669, 0.09264843, 0.008260536, 0.037326172, 0.023025231, -0.026735194, -0.03972619, -0.0132759195,